WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.243 --> 00:00:25.252
Mama was still frozen on the stoop, staring at Iris and Javier. "Tell me you didn't do this on purpose. Now I'll have to take you there."

2
00:00:25.253 --> 00:00:29.495
Iris couldn't bear the crushed look on Mama's face.

3
00:00:29.496 --> 00:00:38.407
Mama was going to be late to her first day of work, and it was all their fault. Or rather, Javier's fault.

4
00:00:38.408 --> 00:00:45.493
"I'm sorry," Javier mumbled, but Iris could tell the apology wouldn't be enough.

5
00:00:45.494 --> 00:00:53.327
Mama's jaw clenched. "Take these." She shoved the lunches into Iris' hands.

6
00:00:53.328 --> 00:01:02.717
"I'm going to see if Mrs. Jones will lend me her car so I can drive you." She stormed back inside.

7
00:01:02.718 --> 00:01:09.218
"Good going, Javier." Iris rolled her eyes. "What kind of plan was that?"

8
00:01:09.219 --> 00:01:13.724
"I didn't think it through," he muttered.

9
00:01:13.724 --> 00:01:22.049
"No kidding." Iris handed one of the lunches to Javier and stuffed the other in her backpack.

10
00:01:22.050 --> 00:01:31.198
"Let's go." Moments later Mama returned, holding Mrs. Jones' car keys.

11
00:01:31.199 --> 00:01:39.950
She led the way around the corner to where the car was parked. Nobody said a word.

12
00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:51.270
Iris slipped into the backseat of the rusty Honda, hoping to stay as far from Mama as she could, and Javier did the same.

13
00:01:51.271 --> 00:02:00.424
Mama started up the car. "You see why I can't leave you two alone while I'm at work?

14
00:02:00.425 --> 00:02:03.908
This was completely irresponsible!"

15
00:02:03.909 --> 00:02:09.656
"I said I was sorry," Javier said. "I won't do it again."

16
00:02:09.657 --> 00:02:17.513
"No, you won't. Tomorrow I'll have to watch you to make sure you have everything and get on that bus."

17
00:02:17.514 --> 00:02:23.787
She braked at a traffic light and turned around to face them.

18
00:02:23.788 --> 00:02:28.930
"Also, in case you were wondering, you're both grounded."

19
00:02:28.930 --> 00:02:35.166
"What?" Iris sat straight up. "I had nothing to do with this."

20
00:02:35.167 --> 00:02:44.883
"I don't want to hear it!" Mama held up a hand. "No gaming or soccer or friends for the rest of the week."

21
00:02:44.884 --> 00:02:51.056
No soccer or friends? Iris scrunched down on the seat, miserable.

22
00:02:51.057 --> 00:02:59.127
Sometimes she liked having a twin brother. But today was definitely not one of those days!

23
00:02:59.128 --> 00:03:07.382
"Be good at camp," Mama said when she dropped them off. "Both of you had better keep out of trouble."

24
00:03:07.383 --> 00:03:11.879
"Bye, Mama," Iris said. "Good luck at work."

25
00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:18.950
Mama only waved in return, and Iris knew it was because she was still mad at them.

26
00:03:18.951 --> 00:03:28.866
Javier headed toward a table with a huge sign: Welcome to Camp Tennis 4 All.

27
00:03:28.867 --> 00:03:33.445
With a sigh, Iris followed him.

28
00:03:33.446 --> 00:03:42.936
Two older teenagers stood behind the table, bright smiles on their faces and name tags stuck on their white tennis outfits.

29
00:03:42.936 --> 00:03:47.416
The girl had blond hair pulled back in a sporty ponytail.

30
00:03:47.417 --> 00:03:54.082
According to her name tag, she was Ally. The boy's name was Trent.

31
00:03:54.083 --> 00:04:01.044
As Iris and Javier approached, Trent squinted at a clipboard.

32
00:04:01.045 --> 00:04:05.262
"These are the last ones!" he called to someone.

33
00:04:05.262 --> 00:04:14.588
"You must be Iris and Javier." He handed them each a name tag and placed a check mark next to their names on a list.

34
00:04:14.589 --> 00:04:22.407
"All right, then." A gray-haired woman wearing a visor stepped out of a small building.

35
00:04:22.408 --> 00:04:26.896
She took the clipboard from Trent as if she was in charge.

36
00:04:26.897 --> 00:04:36.152
"You two can come along with me for announcements, and then we'll split everyone up into groups for lessons."

37
00:04:36.153 --> 00:04:44.025
The woman led the way to a field beside the tennis courts, where about twenty kids were gathered on bleachers.

38
00:04:44.026 --> 00:04:50.191
Iris stared. Everyone else was wearing brightly colored tennis outfits.

39
00:04:50.192 --> 00:04:58.859
Iris glanced down at her navy blue gym shorts and black T-shirt. It was the outfit she often wore to soccer practice.

40
00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:05.430
It looked similar to what Javier was wearing but nothing like the other kids' clothes.

41
00:05:05.431 --> 00:05:09.597
"This is not the way to blend in," she thought.

42
00:05:09.598 --> 00:05:17.918
She glanced at Javier, but he simply shrugged and climbed the bleachers to sit next to another boy sitting by himself.

43
00:05:17.919 --> 00:05:21.431
Iris sat below Javier.

44
00:05:21.431 --> 00:05:30.669
"Good morning!" the gray-haired woman said. "I'm Julie, the camp director. The schedule for today is simple.

45
00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:35.825
We'll divide you into two groups and do some tryouts on the courts.

46
00:05:35.826 --> 00:05:42.848
Then we'll put you in groups based on your abilities." She tapped a pen on her clipboard.

47
00:05:42.849 --> 00:05:50.562
"After lunch, you'll begin lessons. Who's looking forward to the next three weeks at Camp Tennis 4 All?"

48
00:05:50.563 --> 00:05:54.059
"Me!" shouted most of the kids.

49
00:05:54.060 --> 00:06:02.553
Iris turned to look at Javier. He was just sitting there, but the boy next to him pumped his fist in the air.

50
00:06:02.554 --> 00:06:11.124
"Woo!" he called. The boy's dark hair was short and spiky, and his name tag read, Jae.

51
00:06:11.125 --> 00:06:15.072
He had deep brown eyes and a nice smile.

52
00:06:15.073 --> 00:06:18.760
"A very nice smile," thought Iris.

53
00:06:18.762 --> 00:06:23.542
Jae pointed from Javier to Iris. "Twins, right?"

54
00:06:23.543 --> 00:06:28.452
Iris and Javier nodded. "Yep," Javier said.

55
00:06:28.452 --> 00:06:33.372
"Twins who are identically bad at tennis!" Iris joked.

56
00:06:33.373 --> 00:06:41.522
"I love tennis," Jae said. "At least, I think I do. This is my first time at tennis camp.

57
00:06:41.523 --> 00:06:47.535
I haven't played a lot of real tennis, but I play table tennis in my basement every day."

58
00:06:47.536 --> 00:06:53.352
"Table tennis?" Javier said. "You mean, like Ping-Pong?"

59
00:06:53.353 --> 00:06:59.025
"Yes." Jae nodded. "I'm the state youth champion."

60
00:06:59.026 --> 00:07:09.257
"Wow." Iris raised her eyebrows. She didn't know much about table tennis, but to be state champion at anything was impressive.

61
00:07:09.258 --> 00:07:14.835
"My soccer team made it to the state playoffs last year, but we didn't win."

62
00:07:14.836 --> 00:07:20.165
"Listen up, everyone!" the counselor named Trent called out.

63
00:07:20.166 --> 00:07:27.157
"Ally's going to take the younger kids. If you're 13 or 14, you're coming with me."

64
00:07:27.158 --> 00:07:30.939
Iris joined the older group with Jae and Javier.

65
00:07:30.940 --> 00:07:35.072
"Let's get started," Trent said with a grin.

66
00:07:35.072 --> 00:07:45.551
He picked up a basket of tennis balls and headed over to one of the courts, where a big crate of rackets sat.

67
00:07:45.552 --> 00:07:51.143
"If you didn't bring your own racket, grab one and find a partner."

68
00:07:51.144 --> 00:07:58.285
Iris certainly hadn't brought her own racket. She got one, and so did Javier and Jae.

69
00:07:58.286 --> 00:08:01.661
"You want to be partners?" Jae asked her.

70
00:08:01.662 --> 00:08:05.461
Yes. Yes, she did.

71
00:08:05.461 --> 00:08:16.209
"Sure," Iris said. Javier paired up with a girl with blond hair and headed to the other end of the court.

72
00:08:16.210 --> 00:08:23.359
Iris noticed him smiling a bit too. Maybe tennis camp would be fun for both of them after all.

73
00:08:23.360 --> 00:08:36.805
Once everyone was ready, Trent tossed some balls to each pair. "Just hit it back and forth to each other, and I'll observe and give you tips."

74
00:08:36.806 --> 00:08:41.944
He began walking around the court.

75
00:08:41.944 --> 00:08:46.582
Iris flushed, remembering her attempt at tennis with Molly.

76
00:08:46.583 --> 00:08:57.538
Then she glanced at Jae. She hoped she wasn't about to embarrass herself again.
